Aquarium (Garmin Connect IQ app for the fenix 7S)

A hand translation to Monkey C of the tank from
https://github.com/francistse/esp32-cyd-aquarium (commit 80449b3, 18 Oct 2026),
itself a fork of Lagerpun/esp32-cyd-aquarium, adapted from Livegrid OpenMatrix.
Those projects are licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0,
and so is this one (see LICENSE). Not an official Livegrid project.

Modified by pelgraine, October 2026: translated the simulation and drawing to
Monkey C for the Garmin fenix 7S, moved the tank onto a round screen, redrew
the common fish, the clownfish, the blue tang and the large species as
outlines, replaced the noise-driven
steering, and dropped the tank camera, Wi-Fi clock and sensor features.

Colour conversion (Colour.mc) follows FastLED's hsv2rgb_rainbow as shipped in
drvkmr/GFX_Lite.
